<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 19.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Aug 19.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Monday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	15.15    1.65</p>
<p> 2   Davids Limited	 12.20    0.82</p>
<p> 3   Cudgen R.Z.	    11.36    2.20</p>
<p> 4   Holyman		  10.86    1.75</p>
<p> 5   Natl Consol	    10.47    0.86</p>
<p> 6   Aust Tour		 9.49    0.79</p>
<p> 7   Prime Credit Tr	 8.74    1.11</p>
<p> 8   Prop Income Inv	 8.71    1.15</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   8.41    1.01</p>
<p>10   Natl In Prop	    8.33    1.08</p>
<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	8.23    0.96</p>
<p>12   Colonial Coml	   8.23    2.25</p>
<p>13   Sea World Prop	  8.21    1.45</p>
